# T1.9: screens to compare stock with a core build, from the warm 800M snapshot (no MIDI set-up).
# Main screen, the SETTINGS menu scrolled row by row (PERSONALIZE among them), PERSONALIZE opened,
# then the SYN and FLTR pages, a trig key, and an encoder turn on the FLTR page.
wait-emu 0.5
png 00-main
tap grave            # SETTINGS
wait-emu 0.4
png 01-settings
tap Down
wait-emu 0.2
png 02-down1
tap Down
wait-emu 0.2
png 03-down2
tap Down
wait-emu 0.2
png 04-down3
tap Down
wait-emu 0.2
png 05-down4
tap Down
wait-emu 0.2
png 06-down5
tap Down
wait-emu 0.2
png 07-down6
tap Down
wait-emu 0.2
png 08-down7
tap Down
wait-emu 0.2
png 09-down8
tap Down
wait-emu 0.2
png 10-down9
tap Return           # SYSTEM (the last row: ev_settings would add rows after it)
wait-emu 0.4
png 11-system
tap Escape
wait-emu 0.3
tap Up               # PERSONALIZE
wait-emu 0.2
tap Return
wait-emu 0.4
png 12-personalize   # its rows are built where ev_personalize runs (0x400987a2)
tap Down
wait-emu 0.2
tap Down
wait-emu 0.2
tap Down
wait-emu 0.2
png 13-personalize-down3
tap Escape
wait-emu 0.3
tap Escape
wait-emu 0.3
tap Escape
wait-emu 0.4
png 14-back
tap p                # SYN page
wait-emu 0.4
png 15-syn
tap bracketleft      # FLTR page
wait-emu 0.4
png 16-fltr
tap 1                # encoder A one detent right
wait-emu 0.4
png 17-enc
tap w                # TRIG 2: track 2
wait-emu 0.4
png 18-trk2
